      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to the world of Casino Slots Bet: Bonus Stars, where luck and
    skill decide the outcome of the battle! In this exciting game, players fight
    in the ring using a unique attack method - spinning the slot machine. \nEvery
    time a player wants to hit his opponent, he needs to spin the slot machines.
    If three identical symbols appear on the screen, the player successfully attacks
    the enemy and deals damage to him. However, if the combination does not match,
    the player remains vulnerable to a retaliatory strike from the enemy.             
    \nEach player has a limited amount of health and the goal is to attack the enemy
    quickly and accurately using your luck and strategy."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b42f85bc65d01c4581ad80037096633, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -3863810720724016711, guid: 7b42f85bc65d01c4581ad80037096633, type: 2}
